## 3. Membership & CRM
| Kode Internal (ID) | Nama Fitur (Label di Layar) | Deskripsi / Fungsi |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `MEMBER_VIEW` | Lihat Database Member | Melihat daftar anggota (member) terdaftar. |
| `MEMBER_CREATE` | Daftarkan Member Baru | Mendaftarkan pelanggan reguler menjadi member baru. |
| `MEMBER_EDIT` | Edit Profil Member | Mengubah data anggota (nama, no. HP, alamat, dll). |
| `MEMBER_DELETE` | Hapus Data Member | Menghapus keanggotaan pelanggan. |
| `MEMBER_DEPOSIT_MANAGE` | Kelola Saldo / Deposit Member | Mengisi ulang (Top Up) atau memotong saldo deposit member. |
| `MEMBER_TIER_MANAGE` | Atur Level/Tier Member | Mengubah tingkatan member (misal: Bronze, Silver, VIP). |
| `MEMBER_POINT_MANAGE` | Kelola Poin Reward Member | Menyesuaikan atau menukarkan poin reward anggota secara manual. |

